  {
   "title": "Exterior Details",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The exterior came to life with custom scenic animatronic details, including a jaw dropping Marley door knocker, haunted shutters, a swinging chandelier, and a supernatural clock that triggered cinematic moments. A perched animated crow and swinging Scrooge &amp; Marley storefront sign added more dynamic, story-driven moments. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Snowfall and sound design enhanced the Victorian winter, building suspense for key narrative moments. As night fell, the experience transformed into a supernatural spectacle with ghostly apparitions, low-hanging fog, flickering candlelight, and illuminated exterior ice bringing the haunted Victorian setting to life.</p>"
    },
