  {
   "title": "Johnny Depp SUrprise",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>For a mega surprise, Johnny Depp into character to rain his disdain for cheer upon SDCC attendees. Appearing in full costume and makeup, Johnny interacted with guests through live microphone-amplified commentary. To bring the world of Ebenezer to life beyond the main performance, a robust cast of Victorian-era characters interacted with Johnny and passerbyers throughout the day.</p>"
