  {
   "title": "CREATOR amplification",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We developed a creator strategy built around affinity creators connected to Johnny Depp’s iconic characters, alongside general convention goers who could extend the story beyond the SDCC news cycle. </p>",
     "right": "<p>In addition to creators, we strategically placed cosplayers with larger followings who were themselves Johnny Depp superfans, positioning them to be part of the surprise moment that ultimately went viral.</p>"
